nn5z9Zd", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATon2g2dC.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/RudyGiuliani/status/2125316451183779865", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "I am honored and humbled to receive the Presidential Medal of Freedom from my nation and from President Donald J. Trump. -Rudy", "last_comment_created": 1795575114331, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 50, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": [{"width": 900, "heightRatio": 99, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6kCluWgAANPRb.jpg", "height": 897}, {"width": 1399, "heightRatio": 56, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6kCytWoAAUkl3.jpg", "height": 786}, {"width": 900, "heightRatio": 75, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6kC_RXIAAeJsk.jpg", "height": 675}, {"width": 1196, "heightRatio": 75, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6kDJmXIAAqt7N.jpg", "height": 897}], "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 1675, "created": 1795549903000, "id": "2125316451183779865", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1894103626785693696/iXh1bGXe_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Rudy W. Giuliani", "username": "RudyGiuliani"}, "content": "I am honored and humbled to receive the Presidential Medal of Freedom from my nation and from President Donald J. Trump.\n\nAny and all distinction I have received in public office is fully the result of following the advice of my boss, Ronald Reagan, who said: \"There is no limit", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 20534}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATon2h8h2", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 9, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8954664, "raw_content": "I have had virtually no trouble understanding the King James Bible and because I have come to easily understand it, I have also been much better able to understand many other writings and documents using similar vernacular.\n\nI will agree in that it is vitally important that the Word of God is easily understood by all which is why I am not against the use of contemporary dialect and vernacular in and of itself, but what I have been opposed to is the distortion and watering down of modern translations in the process and it is for this reason that I have placed more trust in the KJV and Geneva Bibles for accuracy in translation than in more modern versions.\n\nWhat I would love to see is an English translation of scripture that none would have any trouble understanding but at the same time preserves the integrity of scripture just as has been done within the KJV and Geneva translations of scripture.\n\nI have said often that if there is any doubt as to the integrity and trustworthiness of any given translation of scripture, a Strong's Concordance is highly recommended as it is useful for crosschecking the translated words with the tongues from which they were translated as the Strong's Concordance lists every possible meaning, usage, and application of each word in the Greek and Hebrew languages.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlqh43ozuxs\n", "author": "ContendersEdge", "created": 1795610895740, "profile_picture": "OTUZVRkFHNZn", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "E-dantes-87", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "I have had virtually no trouble understanding the King James Bible...\n", "last_comment_created": 1795612855846, "content": "<p>I have had virtually no trouble understanding the King James Bible and because I have come to easily understand it, I have also been much better able to understand many other writings and documents using similar vernacular.</p>\n<p>I will agree in that it is vitally important that the Word of God is easily understood by all which is why I am not against the use of contemporary dialect and vernacular in and of itself, but what I have been opposed to is the distortion and watering down of modern translations in the process and it is for this reason that I have placed more trust in the KJV and Geneva Bibles for accuracy in translation than in more modern versions.</p>\n<p>What I would love to see is an English translation of scripture that none would have any trouble understanding but at the same time preserves the integrity of scripture just as has been done within the KJV and Geneva translations of scripture.</p>\n<p>I have said often that if there is any doubt as to the integrity and trustworthiness of any given translation of scripture, a Strong's Concordance is highly recommended as it is useful for crosschecking the translated words with the tongues from which they were translated as the Strong's Concordance lists every possible meaning, usage, and application of each word in the Greek and Hebrew languages.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlqh43ozuxs\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlqh43ozuxs</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 9, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {